              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ciy 18:7-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino swiilila makani aya, uwe sizisobano uukede cakuliiba, uuamba mumoyo wakwe kuti, Mpondi mebo, nkabela taakwe umbi; nsikooyookala mbuli mukamufu nikuba kufwidwa bana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
