          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbubo! Kocikakatila kunsengo zyako azisondyo zyako zinji, nziwakalemezegwa lyoonse kuzwa kubwanike bwako. Ambweni ulakonzya kugwasigwa nzizyo, ambweni ulayoosya basinkondonyoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walemenwa indayo zyako zinji. Babuke basikulingula ijulu abasikweebela inyenyeezi abaabo babwene myezi mbiibede, bakuvune kuzwa kumapenzi aati kakusikile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NAM.1.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nah 1:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ncobeni baba mbuli buungu. Mulilo uyoobatenta. Tabakooyoolivuna kunguzu zyamabangabanga. Oyo mulilo tuuli malasa aakujisya insima nanka mulilo wakuyotayota buyo pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ciy 18:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobo mbuziyookubeda zintu ezyo nziwakalemezegwa, Abo mbowakali kuulana abo kuzwa kubwanike bwako bayooinka, umwi aumwi munzila yakwe njayanda. Takukooyooba umwi uukufutula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
